  "ingredients": [
    "2 cups all-purpose flour",
    "1.25 cups white sugar",
    "1 teaspoon baking soda",
    "0.5 teaspoon salt",
    "2 eggs, beaten",
    "1 cup sour cream",
    "3 cups diced rhubarb",
    "1 cup white sugar",
    "0.25 cup butter, softened",
    "0.25 cup all-purpose flour",
    "0.25 teaspoon ground cinnamon, or to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/IvRq86bKa6fT5M-uS5EdRuBDL9k=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-161436-omas-rhubarb-cake-DDMFS-4x3-step-01-89fc69c24f88461996799e879a59bb9a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/161436/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Grease and flour a 9x13-inch baking dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/JaB83TLa1J9eQYM5UiIfzwIJygA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-161436-omas-rhubarb-cake-DDMFS-4x3-step-02-c7be1b4175e046839cfc79daedcd0e74.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/161436/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the cake: Stir together flour, sugar, baking soda, and salt in a large bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/WDaHTc-FiPOpIhFq-A65MFwNdJo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-161436-omas-rhubarb-cake-DDMFS-4x3-step-03-08c1c658e4184dbfbe1392c0516cc876.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/161436/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in eggs and sour cream until smooth, then fold in rhubarb.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/3Z2NTRj6romlR8RCECk0BK5qmfg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-161436-omas-rhubarb-cake-DDMFS-4x3-step-04-1-f8fb9d1b789149a0914ecc3a9432eccb.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/161436/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour into the prepared dish and spread evenly.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/KeUI-RXpBQwsAisZqAs5a0TvaIQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-161436-omas-rhubarb-cake-DDMFS-4x3-step-05-41ae88ae6cc044d8bf5e68c0d84b380f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/161436/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the streusel: Stir together sugar and butter in a medium bowl until smooth. Stir in flour until mixture is crumbly.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/vK0HLpbgrKp2xvGyNJbCieJgCE4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-161436-omas-rhubarb-cake-DDMFS-4x3-step-07-be0589179e894f10b302065d83453e42.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/161436/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sprinkle mixture on top of cake, then dust lightly with cinnamon.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/MTG43btBV2dAXGWnqzBFysAxgws=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-161436-omas-rhubarb-cake-DDMFS-4x3-step-08-edf90f50f8624dde94160fa4e49b1147.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/161436/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until a toothpick inserted in the center comes out clean, about 45 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/5FN9CfCAYS749Qs7FjciStyGqjI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-161436-omas-rhubarb-cake-DDMFS-4x3-step-10-d72fee3f064f4ecdae432430148206e8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/161436/step_08.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
